# Agent Instructions

`[[ project_name ]]`: [[ description ]]

This file holds the rules that no tool checks. Rationale lives in `docs/`.

## Map

- Docs index: [docs/README.md](./docs/README.md). Shared tooling:
  [docs/conventions.md](./docs/conventions.md).
- Tasks: `mise tasks`. Shared tasks: `.config/mise/tasks/`. Project tasks: `mise.toml`
  and `mise-tasks/`.
- Git hooks: `hk.pkl`. A rule that a tool enforces is not listed here. Its error states
  the fix.
- Files in `.config/` belong to the cubert template. Change them in cubert, then run
  `mise run template:update`.
- Reports: `tmp/reports/YYYY-MM-DD-<topic>.md`. Scratch work: `tmp/<task>/`.
[% if openspec != 'none' %]
- Change proposals: `openspec/changes/`.
[% endif %]

